<title>USA: Hadco starts 2.3 mln share offer.</title>
<headline>Hadco starts 2.3 mln share offer.</headline>
<dateline>SALEM, N.H. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hadco Corp said Thursday it had started a public offering of 2.3 million shares of its common stock at $56.875 per share.</p>
<p>Robertson Stephens, Merrill Lynch, and Adams Harkness underwrote the offering.</p>
<p>Hadco shares rose 1-3/4 to 58-3/4 on Nasdaq in early trade.</p>
<p>Hadco makes advanced electronic interconnect products in North America.</p>
